ClaimTest
├── when the distribution does not exist
│   └── it should revert with DistributionDoesNotExist
├── when the distribution is not active
│   └── it should revert with DistributionNotActive
├── when the claim deadline has passed
│   └── it should revert with ClaimDeadlinePassed
├── when the user has already claimed
│   └── it should revert with AlreadyClaimed
├── when the merkle proof is invalid
│   └── it should revert with InvalidProof
├── when the amount is zero
│   └── it should revert with InvalidAmount
└── when all validations pass
    ├── it should mark the user as having claimed
    ├── it should transfer the correct amount to the holder
    ├── it should update claimedAmount
    ├── it should update remainingAmount
    └── it should emit Claimed event

